{"ref":"BDB, עָשֵׁן","hw":"עָשֵׁן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָשֵׁן</span></big>  <strong>adj. smoking</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> of mt. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:15\" href=\"/Exodus.20.15\">Ex 20:18</a> (Gi v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:13\" href=\"/Exodus.20.13\">15</a>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאוּדִים הָעֲשֵׁנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.4\">Is 7:4</a> <em>the smoking firebrands</em> (dying out; in fig.).","next":"BDB, עָשָׁן²","prev":"BDB, עָשַׁן"}